              109.62728881835938
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "28.1",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              123.8804702758789,
              94.75901794433594,
              136.9004669189453
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Introduction ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              103.5199966430664,
              123.8804702758789,
              171.03500366210938,
              136.9004669189453
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The fifth of five types of aviation weather information discussed in this handbook is aviation weather tools. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              144.60244750976562,
              542.6441040039062,
              155.5824432373047
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aviation weather tools are web-based applications that incorporate multiple weather products into a ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              157.20242309570312,
              542.8049926757812,
              168.1824188232422
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "web-based interactive display. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              169.86245727539062,
              208.2050018310547,
              180.8424530029297
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This chapter will describe three web-based interactive displays: the GFA Tool, the Flight Service’s ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              188.52243041992188,
              542.8049926757812,
              199.50242614746094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Interactive Map, and the GFA-LA (Graphical Forecasts for Aviation – Low Altitude previously called ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              201.18246459960938,
              542.7206420898438,
              212.16246032714844
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Helicopter Emergency Medical Services HEMS) Tool. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              213.84243774414062,
              316.0249938964844,
              224.8224334716797
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This chapter describes these web-based displays as they are configured in 2022. Enhancements to these ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              232.44247436523438,
              542.7092895507812,
              243.42247009277344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "displays will likely occur in the coming years as technology improves. Users will find information on any ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              245.10244750976562,
              542.3609008789062,
              256.0824279785156
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "enhancements on the providers’ websites. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              257.7624206542969,
              258.30499267578125,
              268.7424011230469
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "page_number": 471,
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "28.2",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              79.6404800415039,
              94.75901794433594,
              92.66048431396484
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Graphical Forecasts for Aviation (GFA) Tool ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              103.5199966430664,
              79.6404800415039,
              343.31500244140625,
              92.66048431396484
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The GFA Tool is a set of web-based displays intended to provide the necessary aviation weather information ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              100.3624496459961,
              542.5890502929688,
              111.34245300292969
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to give users a complete picture of the weather that may impact their flight operations. It is a one-stop shop ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              113.02242279052734,
              542.7870483398438,
              124.00242614746094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "for multiple data fields. The AWC website includes observational data, forecasts, and advisories including ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              125.7024154663086,
              542.775146484375,
              136.6824188232422
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "thunderstorms, clouds, flight category, precipitation, icing, turbulence, and wind. Hourly model data and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              138.30245971679688,
              542.7404174804688,
              149.28245544433594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "forecasts, including information on clouds, flight category, precipitation, icing, turbulence, wind, and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              150.96243286132812,
              542.7442016601562,
              161.9424285888672
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "graphical output from the NWS’ NDFD, are available. Built with modern geospatial information tools, ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              163.62246704101562,
              542.4981689453125,
              174.6024627685547
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "users can pan and zoom to focus on areas of greatest interest. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              176.28244018554688,
              343.5849914550781,
              187.26243591308594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Descriptions of the observations, forecasts, and advisories that are used in the GFA Tool have been ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              194.94247436523438,
              542.5086059570312,
              205.92247009277344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "presented in other chapters within this handbook. This section does not show or describe the many possible ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              207.54244995117188,
              542.4707641601562,
              218.52244567871094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "overlays for the GFA Tool, since the AWC has produced a very thorough and complete description under ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              220.20242309570312,
              542.5253295898438,
              231.1824188232422
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the “Info” tab on the AWC’s GFA Tool website, which also includes a tutorial video. In addition, the ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              232.86245727539062,
              542.4869384765625,
              243.8424530029297
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "GFA Tool will continue to be enhanced; therefore, users will be assured of being informed of the latest ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              245.52243041992188,
              542.8049926757812,
              256.5024108886719
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "GFA Tool information by referring to the “Info” tab on AWC’s GFA Tool website. In fact, a significant ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              258.1824645996094,
              542.7366333007812,
              269.1624450683594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "change was made in late 2023 when the Helicopter Emergency Medical Services (HEMS) tool was moved ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              270.8424377441406,
              542.6027221679688,
              281.8224182128906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "into the GFA and is now the GFA Low Altitude (GFA-LA). This Low Altitude mode focuses on altitudes ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              283.44244384765625,
              542.6207275390625,
              294.42242431640625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "up to 5,000 ft AGL. Overlays include roads, NAVAIDs, airports, and heliports for the entire United States. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              296.1024475097656,
              542.6253662109375,
              307.0824279785156
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "More detail is revealed as you zoom in, and individual layers can be turned on or off independently. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              308.762451171875,
              542.2951049804688,
              319.742431640625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Additional information, including a tutorial, can be found on the AWC’s website. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              321.4224548339844,
              433.4049987792969,
              332.4024353027344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Caution should be applied as users configure the GFA Tool for use. Users can turn on and turn off certain ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              340.08245849609375,
              542.6034545898438,
              351.06243896484375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "functions (e.g., AIRMET and SIGMET overlays for a given geographical area). This can lead to hidden ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              352.68243408203125,
              542.6517944335938,
              363.66241455078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "areas of hazardous weather for a given flightpath. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              365.3424377441406,
              292.864990234375,
              376.3224182128906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Currently, the GFA Tool covers the CONUS, the Gulf of America, the Caribbean, portions of the Atlantic ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              384.00244140625,
              542.6463012695312,
              394.982421875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ocean, and portions of the Pacific Ocean, including the Hawaiian Islands and Alaska. The experimental ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              396.6624450683594,
              542.696533203125,
              407.6424255371094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "GFA Tool became available for Alaska in December 2020 and transitioned into operational status in ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              409.3424377441406,
              542.3389282226562,
              420.3224182128906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "February 2022. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              422.00244140625,
              141.96499633789062,
              432.982421875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "28.2.1",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              446.8804626464844,
              104.52401733398438,
              459.9004821777344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "GFA Static Images ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              112.5199966430664,
              446.8804626464844,
              215.43499755859375,
              459.9004821777344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Some users with limited internet connectivity may access static images via the AWC’s website as well as ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              467.5424499511719,
              542.7437744140625,
              478.5224304199219
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "from Flight Service’s website (see Appendix G, Websites). There are two static graphical images available ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              480.20245361328125,
              542.7200927734375,
              491.18243408203125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "titled, “Aviation Clouds Forecast” and “Aviation Surface Forecast.” See Section 27.5 for more information. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              492.8624572753906,
              542.8049926757812,
              503.8424377441406
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "28.3",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              517.740478515625,
              94.75901794433594,
              530.7604370117188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "FAA Flight Service’s Interactive Map ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 13.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              103.5199966430664,
              517.740478515625,
              304.5950012207031,
              530.7604370117188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Similar in presentation and functionality to the GFA Tool for weather data and products is the interactive ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              538.46240234375,
              542.3390502929688,
              549.4424438476562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "map on Flight Service’s website. It provides users with interactive graphical capabilities to view a variety ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              551.1224365234375,
              542.49658203125,
              562.1024780273438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of weather and aeronautical information. Users logged in to the website are able to enter basic route ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              563.7824096679688,
              542.4618530273438,
              574.762451171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "information to display the flightpath on the map. Two primary types of weather information can be ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
